.TH PRAZYCRON 1 "4 August 2026" "PrazyCron 2.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
prazycron \- manage Cron jobs and systemd timers in GUI or TUI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B prazycron
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
PrazyCron Task Manager validates, explains, backs up and edits Linux Cron jobs and systemd timers. It provides future-run calculation, execution history, run-now, environment editing, conflict detection and diagnostics.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --gui
Force the graphical interface.
.TP
.B --tui
Force the terminal interface.
.TP
.B --list
Print Cron entries and exit.
.TP
.B --json
Print Cron entries as JSON and exit.
.TP
.BI --analyze " INDEX"
Analyze one Cron entry by one-based index.
.TP
.BI --next " INDEX"
Print the next scheduled executions for a Cron entry.
.TP
.BI --history " INDEX"
Print the recorded execution history for a Cron entry.
.TP
.B --diagnose
Run Cron configuration and service diagnostics.
.TP
.B --systemd-list
Print detected systemd timers.
.TP
.B --version
Show the installed version.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/prazycron/settings.json
.br
.I ~/.local/share/prazycron/backups/
.br
.I ~/.local/share/prazycron/history/
.br
.I ~/.local/share/prazycron/entry-metadata.json
.SH AUTHOR
PrazyCron Project
